    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutanywa kwa Jerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Roho wa Mlungu ukaniwusira na kunireda chia ya mbenge ya mashariki ya Hekalu ya BWANA. Nao ngawona aho mnyangonyi ghwa mbenge wandu mirongo iwi na wasanu, wikwanye na Jaazania mwana wa Azuri, na Pelatia mwana wa Benaia, nawo ni wabaa wa wandu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Mlungu ukanizera, “Mwana wa mdamu, awa niwo wandu widungagha malagho gha wuwiwi, na kufunya njama ra wuwiwi andenyi ya ughu muzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawuyaghamba, ‘Ngelo eagha nyumba ndeilighisire, ela muzi ughu ghooka sa nyungu, nesi sa nyama riboie riko nyungunyi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ugho ee mwana wa mdamu, kufunye wulodi aighu yawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Roho wa BWANA ukakaia aighu kwapo, ukanizera, Ghora na wandu wa Israeli huwu, “Ini BWANA naghamba, Huwo niko mwawuyaririkanya, ela ini naichi seji mwawuyaghesha akilinyi konyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwabwaghie wandu wengi andenyi ya ughu muzi, mkachura chia raro na gharia ra wandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba kukaia muzi ughu loli ni nyungu, ela nyama si inyo kungi; mimbi ya wandu muwibwaghie mkaikumba aghadi yaro niyo nyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaobue lufu, ela nichareda wandu wilo nenyo kwa lufu, ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani nichamfunya mfume ughu muzi na kumngira mikonunyi kwa waghenyi; nipate kureda kutanya aighu yenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mchabwaghwa kwa lufu; nichamtanya a manonyi ya Israeli, nenyo mchamanya kukaia ini ne BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ughu muzi ndeghuchaawuya nyungu yenyu, hata inyo ndemchaawuya nyama andenyi yaro, nichamtanya a manonyi ya Israeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nenyo mchamanya kukaia ini ne BWANA. Angu inyo ndemnughie memu yapo, hata kukatisha sharia rapo anduangi; moonugha sharia mookufwananisha na iro mbari ra wandu wimmarie mbai mbai yenyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji nerekoghe ngifunya wulodi, Pelatia mwana wa Benaia ukafwa. Niko ngaghwa kiwushu-wushu, ngamlilia BWANA kwa lwaka lubaa ngighamba, “Ai e Bwana MLUNGU! Wele kuaghimeria masighariko gha wandu wa Israeli putu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilaghiro ja Mlungu kwa wandu wibarishiro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko BWANA ukaghora nani ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, Awandu wikaiagha Jerusalemu waawuyazera wanyinyu awo wanyinyu weni wiko wubarishonyi, wandu wose putu wa Israeli wei waghendie kula na BWANA. Nao kedi awo niwo winekelo ijo isanga jiwuye jawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo kuwighorie ini Bwana MLUNGU naghora hata ngera nawifunyire na kuwighenja kula kwa iro mbari ra wandu na hata ngera nawisaghisire masangenyi, ela sena nichakaia andwamweri nawo kwa ngelo vui andenyi ya agho masanga wereghendieghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa huwo kuwighorie kukaia ini Bwana MLUNGU nichawikwanya wifume kwa awo wandu na kuwitumbanya chiaimweri kufuma kwa agho masanga andu weresaghisiroghe; nani nichawineka isanga ja Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ngelo wichaawuya wichainja nambai vilambo vose vizamie na wuchafu ghose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani nichawibonya wikaie na nia imweri, na kungira roho mbishi andenyi kwawo. Nichainja ija ngolo ikurie sa igho ifume andenyi kwawo, nani nichawineka ngolo esikira,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.36.26+EZK.36.27+EZK.36.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze. 36.26-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eri wipate kunugha sharia rapo na kuiwadia memu yapo na kuikatisha; nawo wichakaia wandu wapo, nani nichakaia Mlungu wawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela awo wandu wikufunyire kubonya maza rizamie, na wuchafu, nichawikaba kwa wundu ghwa mawiwi ghawo. Ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wubaa ghwa Mlungu kuinjika Jerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko agho makerubi ghikakuchua mawawa ghawo, na agho magurudumu ghikakaia chuwarunyi rawo; wubaa ghwa Mlungu wa Israeli ghukakaia aighu kwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.43.2+EZK.43.3+EZK.43.4+EZK.43.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze. 43.2-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ugho wubaa ghwa BWANA ghukainjika Jerusalemu na kujoka nokoighu; ghukakaria aighu ya mghondi ghuko chia ya mashariki ya muzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
